WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-reelshort-6a3f6465934d3e8b110840c2 — Episode 16 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-27 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:08.610
Madam, what are you doing?

2
00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:10.110
I'm here to find Vincent.

3
00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:14.110
Arthur is on a business trip, and I promised him I'd look after the boy.

4
00:00:15.110 --> 00:00:18.610
Madam, this is the storage room for the late Mrs. Isadora's relics.

5
00:00:18.610 --> 00:00:21.610
No one is allowed to enter except Mr. Vincent and me.

6
00:00:22.110 --> 00:00:24.110
You'd better stay out of trouble, Madam.

7
00:00:24.110 --> 00:00:26.610
By the way, Mr. Vincent is in a bad mood.

8
00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:29.110
He went to the underground boxing ring in the West District.

9
00:00:29.110 --> 00:00:30.610
The underground boxing ring?

10
00:00:30.610 --> 00:00:51.180
Hey, beauty. Dressed so nicely. Who are you looking for? That maniac in the ring?

11
00:00:51.680 --> 00:00:52.680
No, I'm his mother.

12
00:01:03.810 --> 00:01:07.310
Boss, I heard someone set up a trap in the casino a few times lately.

13
00:01:07.810 --> 00:01:08.810
Y-yes.

14
00:01:09.310 --> 00:01:11.810
Someone set up a gambling dem here. I couldn't stop them.

15
00:01:11.810 --> 00:01:12.810
Someone?

16
00:01:12.810 --> 00:01:15.810
Boss, I know I was wrong! I'll never do it again!
